{%- comment -%}
  GIVE HERO — the Give page's video hero (Assets/Lava/Partials/VideoHero.lava,
  Styles/_video-hero.scss).

  Block:                    an HTML block in the Give page's Feature zone
  Block content:            {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/GiveHero.lava' %}
  Enabled Lava Commands:    the same as the current give block (the Merlin
                            shortcode runs there today)
  Cache Duration:           0
  Page:                     InnerDefault, PageHeaderStyle Hidden, DarkHeader
                            checked, Page Cacheability No-Store (Merlin needs it)

  The lead line under "Give" is set here (heroLead); delete it to use the
  page's Description (Page Properties) instead.
  This block also loads the Merlin widget script that the Give now button in
  the Main zone's Online tile (Resources/PageContent/Give.html) uses, so keep
  the shortcode here.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign heroMediaId = 733 -%}
{%- assign heroLead = 'Give online, by text, by mail or in person.' -%}
{%- capture heroActions -%}
  {[ simplemerlinwidget widgetkey:'01JB2RYN938GRYZTXJKXWM9RV9' buttonclasses:'btn btn--primary' buttontext:'Give now' primarycolor:'#9BC93C' ]}
{%- endcapture -%}
{% include '~~/Assets/Lava/Partials/VideoHero.lava' %}
